# WebOS desktop set — Hyprland/Wayland, black-transparent rice.
# Display manager. SDDM is the shipped greeter (see webos-desktop RDEPEND);
# listing it here means a fresh chroot gets it even though the meta package
# itself is only pulled on demand.
gui-apps/sddm

# Compositor (Hyprland stack comes from ::hyproverlay)
gui-wm/hyprland
gui-apps/hyprpaper
gui-apps/hypridle
